cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AD Library Benchmarks"
message: "If you use these benchmarks or refer to their results, please cite this repository."
type: software
version: "2026.11"
date-released: 2026-11-11
authors:
  - name: "Xcelerit Computing Ltd."
    website: "https://www.xcelerit.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/auto-differentiation/ad-benchmarks"
url: "https://github.com/auto-differentiation/ad-benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  C++ benchmark suite comparing automatic differentiation libraries
  (XAD, Adept 2, CppAD, autodiff) on four
  quantitative-finance workloads: a LIBOR market model swaption
  portfolio, Heston stochastic volatility Monte Carlo, CVA on a swap
  portfolio, and SABR smile calibration.
keywords:
  - automatic differentiation
  - adjoint methods
  - AAD
  - benchmark
  - quantitative finance
  - Monte Carlo
  - XVA
  - XAD
